{"id":"5ef8327905835e84","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-prime-ideal-theorem.md","title":"Prime Ideal Theorem","display":"thm-prime-ideal-theorem — Prime Ideal Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-prime-ideal-theorem","aliases":["58-thm-prime-ideal-theorem"],"display":"thm-prime-ideal-theorem — Prime Ideal Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-prime-ideal-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-prime-ideal-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-prime-ideal-theorem — Prime Ideal Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"92bf09d894f8282f\" href=\"?note=92bf09d894f8282f\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md\">../batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md\">../batch01/58-ax-ac.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\in V\">\\(A \\in V\\)</span> (set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span> (proper ideal on the Boolean algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}(P,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}(P,A)\\)</span> (prime ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"92bf09d894f8282f\" href=\"?note=92bf09d894f8282f\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md\">../batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in V\\;\\forall I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\;\n\\left[\n\\varnothing\\in I\n\\land A\\notin I\n\\land\\forall X,Y\\in I\\;(X\\cup Y\\in I)\n\\land\\forall X\\in I\\;\\forall Y\\subseteq X\\;(Y\\in I)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\exists P\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}(P,A)\\land I\\subseteq P\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in V\\;\\forall I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\;\n\\left[\n\\varnothing\\in I\n\\land A\\notin I\n\\land\\forall X,Y\\in I\\;(X\\cup Y\\in I)\n\\land\\forall X\\in I\\;\\forall Y\\subseteq X\\;(Y\\in I)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\exists P\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}(P,A)\\land I\\subseteq P\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Properness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\notin I\">\\(A\\notin I\\)</span> is indispensable; an improper ideal cannot be contained in a prime ideal.</li>\n<li>This is the Boolean prime ideal theorem for a powerset algebra. It follows from choice and is strictly weaker than the full axiom of choice over ZF.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"92bf09d894f8282f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A \\in V$ (set, see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"92bf09d894f8282f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}(P,A)$ (prime ideal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}(P,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in V\\;\\forall I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\;\n\\left[\n\\varnothing\\in I\n\\land A\\notin I\n\\land\\forall X,Y\\in I\\;(X\\cup Y\\in I)\n\\l